"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p014","text":"田仁上書言：「天下郡太守多為姦利，三河尤甚，臣請先刺舉三河。三河太守皆內倚中貴人，與三公有親屬，無所畏憚，宜先正三河以警天下姦吏。」是時河南、河內太守皆御史大夫杜父兄子弟也，河東太守石丞相子孫也。是時石氏九人為二千石，方盛貴。田仁數上書言之。杜大夫及石氏使人謝，謂田少卿曰：「吾非敢有語言也，願少卿無相誣汙也。」仁已刺三河，三河太守皆下吏誅死。仁還奏事，武帝說，以仁為能不畏彊御，拜仁為丞相司直，威振天下。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"田仁","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0076","start":76,"end":81,"surface":"御史大夫杜","kind":"person","person_id":"w8i_dhi_044","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"石丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"ax6_77g_gsd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"田仁","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0121","start":121,"end":124,"surface":"杜大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"w8i_dhi_044","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0132","start":132,"end":135,"surface":"田少卿","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0156","start":156,"end":157,"surface":"仁","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"仁","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"egj_ken_pn3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"仁","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m014-0191","start":191,"end":192,"surface":"仁","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu","book_id":"b-shiji-104","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-104-tianshu"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p015","text":"其後逢太子有兵事，丞相自將兵，使司直主城門。司直以為太子骨肉之親，父子之閒不甚欲近，去之諸陵過。是時武帝在甘泉，使御史大夫暴君下責丞相「何為縱太子」，丞相對言「使司直部守城門而開太子」。上書以聞，請捕系司直。司直下吏，誅死。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"64t_pmo_3d4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"司直","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"司直","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"64t_pmo_3d4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"egj_ken_pn3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0057","start":57,"end":63,"surface":"御史大夫暴君","kind":"person","person_id":"qlq_xq2_1sm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"64t_pmo_3d4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"司直","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"64t_pmo_3d4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"司直","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m015-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"司直","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu","book_id":"b-shiji-104","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-104-tianshu"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p016","text":"是時任安為北軍使者護軍，太子立車北軍南門外，召任安，與節令發兵。安拜受節，入，閉門不出。武帝聞之，以為任安為詳邪，不傅事，何也？任安笞辱北軍錢官小吏，小吏上書言之，以為受太子節，言「幸與我其鮮好者」。書上聞，武帝曰：「是老吏也，見兵事起，欲坐觀成敗，見勝者欲合從之，有兩心。安有當死之罪甚眾，吾常活之，今懷詐，有不忠之心。」下安吏，誅死。夫月滿則虧，物盛則衰，天地之常也。知進而不知退，久乘富貴，禍積為祟。故范蠡之去越，辭不受官位，名傳後世，萬歲不忘，豈可及哉！後進者慎戒之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"64t_pmo_3d4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"egj_ken_pn3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"64t_pmo_3d4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"egj_ken_pn3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"安","kind":"person","perso